( Exp 028: Stack ops and divmod — 2xchg`, 2r`, 3dup`, /%`, /`, %` )

( 2xchg — swap TOS with third item: a b c → c b a )
: 2xchg` swap` >rswapr>` swap` ;

( 2r@ — read two items from return stack )
( Non-fall-through version: inlines both reads )
: 2r` over` $48, ,1 $5C8B, s08 $24, ,1 $08, ,1
       over` $48, ,1 $1C8B, s08 $24, ,1 ;

( 3dup — triplicate top 3 stack items )
( After 2dup: TOS=c NOS=b [r15]=c,b,a )
( Then: lea r15,[r15-8]; mov rax,[r15+24]; mov [r15],rax )
: 3dup` 2dup` $F87F8D4D, ,4 $18478B49, ,4 $078949, ,3 ;

( /%` — divmod: a b → a%b a/b )
( >S0 ensures rbx=TOS edx=NOS )
( mov rax,rdx; cqo; idiv rbx; mov rbx,rax )
: /%` >S0 $48D08948, ,4 $FBF74899, ,4 $C38948, ,3 ;
: /` /%` nip` ;
: %` /%` drop` ;
